lex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> <strong data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"969\">Original photo ID proof</strong> (Aadhaar Card / PAN Card / Voter ID / Passport).</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 117px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100%; height: 117px;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What details are mentioned on the <strong>admit card?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer: Candidate name, roll number, exam date, reporting time, exam centre address, photograph, and signature.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 89px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100%; height: 89px;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the official website for <b>SSB</b>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The official website for <strong>SSB</strong> is <strong>https://ssb.gov.in/</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-36295 aligncenter\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-44-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"SSB HC (Ministerial) Written Exam Date 2026\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-44-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-44-300x169.jpg 300w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-44-768x432.jpg 768w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-44.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\"></p>\n<p></p>\n</div>\n\